        "text_2014427002": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jun 19 2025 17:47:47 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">About Stryker</span></p>\n<p>Stryker is a global leader in medical technologies and, together with our customers, we are driven to make healthcare better. We offer innovative products and services in MedSurg, Neurotechnology and Orthopaedics that help improve patient and healthcare outcomes. Alongside our customers around the world, we impact more than 150 million patients annually. More information is available at <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/index.html\">www.stryker.com</a>.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 19 2025 17:48:15 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
